# API base for `fetch`. Session cookies are HttpOnly — the browser must send them on each request.
#
# Option A — simplest dev: leave unset; browser hits `/api` on :5173 and Vite proxies to :5000 (same-site cookies).
#
# Option B — direct API URL (tab :5173, API :5000 = cross-site): set e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
# and on the server set CROSS_SITE_COOKIES=1 (plus CLIENT_ORIGIN including http://localhost:5173). Chrome
# still allows Secure session cookies on http://localhost for local dev.
#
# Production split hosts: VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api and CROSS_SITE_COOKIES=1 with HTTPS.
# VITE_API_URL=/api

# Cloudflare Turnstile — public sitekey (browser-safe). Must pair with TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY on the server (same widget).
# Wrong pairing → Turnstile always fails and login/signup never succeed until fixed or server secret removed (dev).
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/
# When unset, the widget is hidden and the API skips verification if no secret is set.
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# Hidden desk admin URL (must start with /, at least 16 chars). Log in (email), create account (token), forgot password.
# Example: VITE_ADMIN_REGISTER_PATH=/r/k7mQ9p2vN4xL8wJ1cH5bF3
# Not linked from the student app. Server: ADMIN_REGISTER_PORTAL_TOKEN for create-account only.
# VITE_ADMIN_REGISTER_PATH=

